error[L0262]: cannot borrow `count` as mutable, as it is not declared as mutable (E0596)
  --> tests/corpus/reject/borrow_immutable.lc:10:10
   |
10 |     bump(&mut count); //~ error: L0262 cannot borrow `count` as mutable, as it is not declared as mutable (E0596)
   |          ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: a `&mut` argument is rooted at a binding the call may assign: declare it `let mut count`, or as a parameter `mut count: T` or `count: &mut T`
