error[L0262]: cannot borrow `*n` as mutable, as it is behind a `&` reference (E0596)
  --> tests/corpus/reject/borrow_immutable.lc:20:10
   |
20 |     bump(&mut n); //~ error: L0262 cannot borrow `*n` as mutable, as it is behind a `&` reference (E0596)
   |          ^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `n` is a `&` parameter, read and never written; to write through it, take `n: &mut T`
